    <summary>AbaClient - log-in into your AbaWeb</summary>
    <description>AbaClient allows to log-in into your Abacus Business Software or AbaWeb - without any internet browser and without having java installed.

## Package Parameters
- `/Language:&lt;value&gt;` - Installer language. Accepted values (case-insensitive): `en` / `english`, `de` / `german`, `fr` / `french`, `it` / `italian`.

If no language is given, it is detected from the Windows system locale. Locales without an AbaClient installer fall back to English.

Example: `choco install abaclient --params "'/Language:english'"`

Parameters are not remembered on `choco upgrade` by default. Pass them again, or enable `choco feature enable -n useRememberedArgumentsForUpgrades`.
</description>
	  <releaseNotes>Release notes are shown within the application from now on.</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools/**" target="tools" />
